# Use actual IDs from GET /api/products/ and /api/pharmacies/.
# Replace the token placeholders in your REST client. Never supply real payment secrets.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@access = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Health
GET {{base}}/health/

### Register a customer (choose a unique username/email)
POST {{base}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"course_customer","email":"course_customer@example.test","password":"Replace-With-Your-Own-Password","full_name":"Course Customer"}

### Sign in
POST {{base}}/auth/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"course_customer","password":"Replace-With-Your-Own-Password"}

### Public catalogue
GET {{base}}/products/?search=ДЕРМАЗОЛ

### Quote (substitute valid IDs)
POST {{base}}/checkout/quote/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"pharmacy_id":1,"fulfillment_method":"PICKUP","items":[{"product_id":1,"quantity":1}]}

### Place using the quoted unit price and grand total
POST {{base}}/orders/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"pharmacy_id":1,"fulfillment_method":"PICKUP","payment_method":"CARD","expected_total":"100.00","items":[{"product_id":1,"quantity":1,"expected_unit_price":"100.00"}]}

### Start simulated payment for the actual created order
POST {{base}}/orders/1/pay/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"idempotency_key":"course-payment-unique-0001"}

### Inspect asynchronous payment and shipment results
GET {{base}}/orders/1/fulfillment/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Assigned staff transition; use a staff token
POST {{base}}/orders/1/transition/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"PROCESSING"}
